[CENTER]
[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#f1c40f]📖 CustomDungeons Documentation[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=3][COLOR=#95a5a6]Complete Setup & Configuration Guide[/COLOR][/SIZE]
