[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#e67e22]🚀 1. QUICK START GUIDE[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=3]
Follow these simple steps to get your first dungeon running in under 3 minutes:
[/SIZE]

[B]Step 1: Install the plugin[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Place [B]CustomDungeons.jar[/B] into your server's [B]/plugins/[/B] folder.
[*](Optional) Ensure [B]PlaceholderAPI[/B] and [B]Vault[/B] are installed if you wish to use placeholders and economy entry costs.
[*]Start or restart your server. Default configuration files will be generated automatically.
[/LIST]

[B]Step 2: Create a Dungeon[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Stand at the desired lobby/waiting area and run:
[CODE]/cd admin create myfirstdungeon
/cd admin setlobby myfirstdungeon[/CODE]
[*]Fly to the starting spawn point inside the arena and run:
[CODE]/cd admin setspawn myfirstdungeon[/CODE]
[*]Stand at the victory/defeat exit position outside the dungeon and run:
[CODE]/cd admin setexit myfirstdungeon[/CODE]
[/LIST]

[B]Step 3: Test and Play[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Open the menu: [B]/cd menu[/B] or join directly via [B]/cd join myfirstdungeon[/B].
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#3498db]⚙️ 2. CONFIGURATION STRUCTURE[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#f39c12]dungeons/<dungeon>.yml[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[CODE=yaml]
enabled: true
display-name: "&6Forgotten Catacombs"
description: "A dark labyrinth crawling with undead beasts."
min-players: 1
max-players: 4
lives: 3
time-limit-seconds: 600

requirements:
  permission: "customdungeons.access.catacombs"
  min-level: 5
  cost: 100.0

rewards:
  commands:
    - "give {player} diamond 3"
    - "eco give {player} 500"
  experience: 250
  loot-table: "catacombs_boss"

stages:
  1:
    name: "The Crypt Gates"
    duration-seconds: 180
    objectives:
      - type: KILL_MOBS
        entity: ZOMBIE
        amount: 8
        display-name: "Slay Crypt Walkers"
    clear-commands:
      - "broadcast &8[&6Dungeon&8] &aStage 1 cleared by {player}!"
  2:
    name: "The Boss Chamber"
    duration-seconds: 300
    objectives:
      - type: KILL_MOBS
        entity: WITHER_SKELETON
        amount: 1
        display-name: "Vanquish the Crypt Overlord"
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#2ecc71]🎯 3. OBJECTIVE TYPES[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]KILL_MOBS:[/B] Slay a specified amount of living entities.
[CODE=yaml]
- type: KILL_MOBS
  entity: ZOMBIE
  amount: 10
  display-name: "Kill 10 Zombies"
[/CODE]

[*][B]INTERACT_BLOCK:[/B] Interact with or activate specific blocks in the arena.
[CODE=yaml]
- type: INTERACT_BLOCK
  material: LEVER
  amount: 2
  display-name: "Pull 2 Levers"
[/CODE]

[*][B]SURVIVE_TIME:[/B] Survive incoming waves for the specified duration.
[CODE=yaml]
- type: SURVIVE_TIME
  amount: 60
  display-name: "Survive the onslaught for 60s"
[/CODE]
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#9b59b6]💎 4. PLACEHOLDERS[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]%customdungeons_in_dungeon%[/B] - Returns true/false whether player is in a session.
[*][B]%customdungeons_current%[/B] - Display name of the active dungeon.
[*][B]%customdungeons_stage%[/B] - Active stage number.
[*][B]%customdungeons_lives%[/B] - Remaining lives for the player.
[*][B]%customdungeons_time%[/B] - Formatted timer (MM:SS).
[*][B]%customdungeons_party_size%[/B] - Member count of current party.
[*][B]%customdungeons_party_leader%[/B] - Leader of the current party.
[/LIST]
